{"schemaVersion":1,"storyId":"kofis-colourful-garden","version":1,"title":"Kofi’s Colourful Garden","ageTiers":["3-4","5-6"],"language":"en","narrationLocale":"en-GH","pages":[{"n":1,"text":"Kofi had a little patch of soil behind his house. ‘I will make a garden,’ he said. Maame gave him some seeds.","sentences":["Kofi had a little patch of soil behind his house.","‘I will make a garden,’ he said.","Maame gave him some seeds."],"image":"sha256:962b82b56664fb9eca26e2465e398860a3f192fc4615cbde9af8ad94373ee307","alt":"A boy looks at a small patch of brown soil behind a house while his mother hands him a paper packet of seeds.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:42cc7049c787588ff9d3ca905f01170b1095a9705c8aba75de4266aa9e5112b5","durationMs":10427,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4506],[4506,8040],[8040,10427]],"words":[[0,353],[353,618],[618,795],[795,1325],[1325,1767],[1767,1944],[1944,2297],[2297,2827],[2827,3092],[3092,4506],[4506,4683],[4683,5036],[5036,5389],[5389,5566],[5566,6538],[6538,6715],[6715,8040],[8040,8482],[8482,8835],[8835,9100],[9100,9453],[9453,10427]]}}},{"n":2,"text":"Kofi dug little holes. He put one seed in each hole and covered it with soil. Then he gave the soil a drink of water.","sentences":["Kofi dug little holes.","He put one seed in each hole and covered it with soil.","Then he gave the soil a drink of water."],"image":"sha256:7ce7a064c3e7f8e5de92f0506089f072d5a42b8cba79ef356f36cdf3bbdb1e70","alt":"Kofi kneels and drops a seed into a small hole, with a watering can beside him.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:00d7b8c152d03864055b0c7523b403f8bf4da8e0a46b5555b9054fecc2c8e2bd","durationMs":15035,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3664],[3664,10359],[10359,15035]],"words":[[0,505],[505,884],[884,1642],[1642,3664],[3664,3917],[3917,4296],[4296,4675],[4675,5180],[5180,5433],[5433,5938],[5938,6443],[6443,6822],[6822,7706],[7706,7959],[7959,8464],[8464,10359],[10359,10864],[10864,11117],[11117,11622],[11622,12001],[12001,12506],[12506,12759],[12759,13391],[13391,13644],[13644,15035]]}}},{"n":3,"text":"One day passed. Two days passed. Three days passed. Nothing came up. ‘Maybe the seeds are sleeping,’ said Kofi.","sentences":["One day passed.","Two days passed.","Three days passed.","Nothing came up.","‘Maybe the seeds are sleeping,’ said Kofi."],"image":"sha256:4c1c0e670476872bf1ef1553aa1dba465a235e4a19859f323132b624d3f3bb6f","alt":"Kofi looks closely at flat soil with his chin on his hands.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:345265cc7737947ea2f9ec2bdc49421b5e4ecfa5b19360e2c5010ee8d6ea1b38","durationMs":14675,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,2410],[2410,4925],[4925,7650],[7650,10166],[10166,14675]],"words":[[0,314],[314,628],[628,2410],[2410,2724],[2724,3143],[3143,4925],[4925,5449],[5449,5868],[5868,7650],[7650,8384],[8384,8803],[8803,10166],[10166,10690],[10690,11004],[11004,11528],[11528,11842],[11842,13205],[13205,13624],[13624,14675]]}}},{"n":4,"text":"Kofi did not give up. Every morning he watered the soil and sang a little song. Then, one morning, he saw something small and green!","sentences":["Kofi did not give up.","Every morning he watered the soil and sang a little song.","Then, one morning, he saw something small and green!"],"image":"sha256:91a7ac9325728be87da6a76cb8d353d556d8d32c06397880b8e9f18ac856b945","alt":"Kofi sings while watering; a tiny green sprout pushes through the soil.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:80f2a7692abe2ac1fdddc8b939c0e8890142e85f7ef83729279abe13e2ff8aab","durationMs":17843,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3394],[3394,10683],[10683,17843]],"words":[[0,503],[503,880],[880,1257],[1257,1760],[1760,3394],[3394,4022],[4022,4902],[4902,5153],[5153,6033],[6033,6410],[6410,6913],[6913,7290],[7290,7793],[7793,8044],[8044,8798],[8798,10683],[10683,11814],[11814,12191],[12191,13699],[13699,13950],[13950,14327],[14327,15458],[15458,16086],[16086,16463],[16463,17843]]}}},{"n":5,"text":"Soon the garden grew tall. There were three red tomatoes. There were two green okra pods. ‘So many colours!’ said Kofi.","sentences":["Soon the garden grew tall.","There were three red tomatoes.","There were two green okra pods.","‘So many colours!’ said Kofi."],"image":"sha256:b4d66c4af497ce3536324ff89178edd5b376f6703f63b99a71cd59c231c4c968","alt":"A garden with three bright red tomatoes and two green okra pods on their plants.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:6339a1a1c034ce28500e4ef91fa43a955d8a901f05ddeb2ceb30e305e84a68b3","durationMs":17603,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3967],[3967,8430],[8430,12893],[12893,17603]],"words":[[0,496],[496,868],[868,1612],[1612,2108],[2108,3967],[3967,4587],[4587,5083],[5083,5703],[5703,6075],[6075,8430],[8430,9050],[9050,9546],[9546,9918],[9918,10538],[10538,11034],[11034,12893],[12893,13141],[13141,13637],[13637,15868],[15868,16364],[16364,17603]]}}},{"n":6,"text":"There were four yellow corn cobs. There were five orange carrots poking out of the soil. Kofi counted them all, one, two, three, four, five.","sentences":["There were four yellow corn cobs.","There were five orange carrots poking out of the soil.","Kofi counted them all, one, two, three, four, five."],"image":"sha256:6ff08d014f76a94c6da856cb195112cd281568dc5490386247ea30f5e8bfe4ba","alt":"Four yellow corn cobs on tall stalks and five orange carrot tops showing in the soil.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:e6304ce6ec2a6a012a64b6c40a37eb5bcc26434e7e60f966cdcc4f5515ee7bd5","durationMs":21923,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,5176],[5176,12667],[12667,21923]],"words":[[0,681],[681,1226],[1226,1771],[1771,2588],[2588,3133],[3133,5176],[5176,5857],[5857,6402],[6402,6947],[6947,7764],[7764,8717],[8717,9534],[9534,9943],[9943,10215],[10215,10624],[10624,12667],[12667,13212],[13212,14165],[14165,14710],[14710,15799],[15799,16888],[16888,17977],[17977,19339],[19339,20565],[20565,21923]]}}},{"n":7,"text":"Kofi picked a basket of vegetables for Maame. ‘Look, Maame, my garden has red, green, yellow and orange!’","sentences":["Kofi picked a basket of vegetables for Maame.","‘Look, Maame, my garden has red, green, yellow and orange!’"],"image":"sha256:a7e281ebd8e851cb6499758251b4a32e1f2fe6ca2d725c04cb2afdb3adf3f8e7","alt":"Kofi proudly holds up a basket of colourful vegetables to his smiling mother.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:afd6ad6db2d94424845f32c20d04d6ff692313719163fa94e3d61c580530bcdd","durationMs":11987,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4978],[4978,11987]],"words":[[0,406],[406,1016],[1016,1219],[1219,1829],[1829,2032],[2032,3048],[3048,3353],[3353,4978],[4978,5892],[5892,6908],[6908,7111],[7111,7721],[7721,8026],[8026,8839],[8839,9855],[9855,10465],[10465,10770],[10770,11987]]}}},{"n":8,"text":"That night they cooked a big pot of soup with the vegetables. Kofi smiled. ‘Waiting was hard, but it was worth it.’ The end.","sentences":["That night they cooked a big pot of soup with the vegetables.","Kofi smiled.","‘Waiting was hard, but it was worth it.’ The end."],"image":"sha256:3bd92987a20c2ed1e0a6a8e6b195b58cf3ece7272203652b37f3bfd4d6a9d6af","alt":"Kofi and his mother share a bowl of soup at a table by candlelight.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:f6250f3f44fc3a15c13f23e26a5788c7c103ebbdcf84b1dd52cd0c4452c756e4","durationMs":16355,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,7178],[7178,9649],[9649,16355]],"words":[[0,471],[471,1059],[1059,1530],[1530,2236],[2236,2471],[2471,2824],[2824,3177],[3177,3412],[3412,3883],[3883,4354],[4354,4707],[4707,7178],[7178,7649],[7649,9649],[9649,10473],[10473,10826],[10826,11885],[11885,12238],[12238,12473],[12473,12826],[12826,13414],[13414,14944],[14944,15297],[15297,16355]]}}}],"activities":[{"id":"kofi-c1","type":"comprehension","afterPage":4,"question":"What did Kofi do 